---
title: "functionCall (LegionBouncer)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_role: onlyRoles(BROADCASTER_ROLE)
    q_check_role --> q_revert: msg.sender does not have BROADCASTER_ROLE
    q_revert --> [*]: revert Unauthorized()
    q_check_role --> q_call: msg.sender has BROADCASTER_ROLE
    q_call --> [*]: target.functionCall(data) - execute arbitrary call on target

    note right of q_call
        INV-001: only BROADCASTER_ROLE holders can execute calls
        INV-002: target and data are unrestricted - any contract and function
        INV-003: LegionBouncer acts as proxy for all Legion admin operations
        INV-004: BROADCASTER_ROLE is ROLE_0 (value 1)
    end note
